Third-party components
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This release bundles no third-party libraries, fonts, dictionaries or data
assets. The application is built only against:

  * The Kotlin standard library — Apache License 2.0
    Copyright 2010-2026 JetBrains s.r.o. and Kotlin Programming Language
    contributors.

  * The Android platform APIs, which are provided by the device and are not
    redistributed in the APK.

Typography uses the fonts already present on the watch (/system/fonts); no font
files are bundled, so no Open Font License obligations apply.

Should any dependency, dictionary or data asset be added in a later release,
its notice must be reproduced here and its full licence text added to
THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md before that release ships.
